#: src/dcc-gui.c:10492
msgid "Switch on direct EC access?"
msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10494
msgid ""
"<b>This can damage your laptop.</b> The fan daemon would then write directly "
"to the Embedded Controller through the I/O ports 0x62/0x66, using the "
"register layout of Clevo laptops. On a laptop with a different layout, these "
"writes can change charging, power or thermal settings, stop the fans or "
"overheat the hardware.\n"
"\n"
"Only use it on a Clevo-based laptop where the dcc_fan module does not load. "
"Before the first write, the daemon checks that the EC answers like a Clevo "
"EC and refuses otherwise, but this check cannot rule out every risk.\n"
"\n"
"You use it at your own risk."
msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10502 src/dcc-gui.c:10580
msgid "Switch on"
msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10505
